      "expected": "In the negative multiplier, the first rectifier should conduct from GND into the pump node, so its anode should be on GND and its cathode on the pump node, matching the Pervasive Displays reference rectifier arrangement.",
      "evidence": [
        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "(node (ref \"U10\") (pin \"2\") (pinfunction \"A\") (pintype \"passive\"))"},
