      ],
      "impact": "If the orientation is reversed, the negative display rail (VGL-type supply) may not be generated, and the EPD panel would not refresh correctly.",
      "confidence": 0.2
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The power section, battery path, EPD boost and charge-pump component values, and the keyboard and SD pin assignments all match the specification. The most concrete deviation is the dangling 0.1uF capacitor C6 with an inductor footprint, and the negative charge-pump diode orientation is a lower-confidence concern, so the overall verdict is weak."
